iv>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Les chaussures","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234584,"_nanoseconds":125000000}},{"id":"Tttl6xGY8RjK8JJzmdXk","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":18,"part":6,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l18-p06-b1","partTitle":"Say it 4/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Je porte un pull bleu.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">I'm wearing a blue sweater.</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Je porte un pull bleu.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234584,"_nanoseconds":202000000}},{"id":"7FFi0yn7hGgz5EnVsD04","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":18,"part":7,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l18-p07-b1","partTitle":"Listen to the conversation","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"opacity:.8;\">Read and listen to the whole conversation first. You play the “You” part next.</p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Salut ! Ça va ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Hi! How are you?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Ça va bien !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I'm good!</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Il fait froid ! Qu'est-ce que tu portes ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">It's cold! What are you wearing?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Je porte un pull.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I'm wearing a sweater.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>De quelle couleur ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">What colour?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Il est vert.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">It's green.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Et sur la tête ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">And on your head?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Je porte un chapeau rouge.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I'm wearing a red hat.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>J'aime ton chapeau !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I like your hat!</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Moi aussi, j'aime mon chapeau !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Me too, I like my hat!</span></p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234584,"_nanoseconds":239000000}},{"id":"uh8KZHpLQTzgh2fLmPXC","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":18,"part":8,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l18-p08-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 1/5","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Salut ! Ça va ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Hi! How are you?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Ça va bien !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I'm good!</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Ça va bien !","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234584,"_nanoseconds":254000000}},{"id":"19yAicFnHMoC2VYBOGXj","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":18,"part":9,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l18-p09-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 2/5","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"ima